"group": "story",
"sub": "Take it to the depot on the west side. Don't scratch her. She's family.",
"who": "marco"
},
{
"id": "s_b290819cf3",
"voice": "benji",
"vid": "e6f9b893-51b1-51d3-afe9-9e0482cb7ac1",
"text": "She rattles, but she rolls. You know what? Keep her.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "She rattles, but she rolls. You know what? Keep her.",
"who": "marco"
},
{
"id": "s_cb5e9c770d",
"voice": "benji",
"vid": "e6f9b893-51b1-51d3-afe9-9e0482cb7ac1",
"text": "My friend Rosa needs a lift from the east side. Be nice — she tips.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "My friend Rosa needs a lift from the east side. Be nice — she tips.",
"who": "marco"
},
{
"id": "s_383c70f4dc",
"voice": "soraya",
"vid": "5c1d2f7f-cdb4-5b1d-bca9-156439e3275e",
"text": "Smooth driving! Marco said you were trouble. He lied.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "Smooth driving! Marco said you were trouble. He lied.",
"who": "rosa"
},
{
"id": "s_0bc178b59a",
"voice": "benji",
"vid": "e6f9b893-51b1-51d3-afe9-9e0482cb7ac1",
"text": "Depot's slammed — three packages, three corners of the city.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "Depot's slammed — three packages, three corners of the city.",
"who": "marco"
},
{
"id": "s_3c7abc41cd",
"voice": "benji",
"vid": "e6f9b893-51b1-51d3-afe9-9e0482cb7ac1",
"text": "Show me that hustle and the depot keeps you on the payroll.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "Show me that hustle and the depot keeps you on the payroll.",
"who": "marco"
},
{
"id": "s_230288bf09",
"voice": "benji",
"vid": "e6f9b893-51b1-51d3-afe9-9e0482cb7ac1",
"text": "Three for three! Officially the fastest wheels in Palm City.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "Three for three! Officially the fastest wheels in Palm City.",
"who": "marco"
},
{
"id": "s_a2be091b12",
"voice": "benji",
"vid": "e6f9b893-51b1-51d3-afe9-9e0482cb7ac1",
"text": "You've got cash burning a hole in your pocket.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "You've got cash burning a hole in your pocket.",
"who": "marco"
},
{
"id": "s_3ab4907891",
"voice": "benji",
"vid": "e6f9b893-51b1-51d3-afe9-9e0482cb7ac1",
"text": "The hot dog cart at the plaza is for sale. Stop earning money — start OWNING it.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "The hot dog cart at the plaza is for sale. Stop earning money — start OWNING it.",
"who": "marco"
},
{
"id": "s_3614ce4526",
"voice": "benji",
"vid": "e6f9b893-51b1-51d3-afe9-9e0482cb7ac1",
"text": "A business owner! Pop always said: own something and it earns while you sleep.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "A business owner! Pop always said: own something and it earns while you sleep.",
"who": "marco"
},
{
"id": "s_f32e05084f",
"voice": "benji",
"vid": "e6f9b893-51b1-51d3-afe9-9e0482cb7ac1",
"text": "Dream bigger, cuz. The car wash on the west side is up for grabs.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "Dream bigger, cuz. The car wash on the west side is up for grabs.",
"who": "marco"
},
{
"id": "s_459aa8d566",
"voice": "benji",
"vid": "e6f9b893-51b1-51d3-afe9-9e0482cb7ac1",
"text": "Save up $2,000 — your cart's income will help.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "Save up $2,000 — your cart's income will help.",
"who": "marco"
},
{
"id": "s_57a587ab87",
"voice": "soraya",
"vid": "5c1d2f7f-cdb4-5b1d-bca9-156439e3275e",
"text": "Half this city washes their car twice a week. You're going to be rich.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "Half this city washes their car twice a week. You're going to be rich.",
"who": "rosa"
},
{
"id": "s_b5e2178f49",
"voice": "benji",
"vid": "e6f9b893-51b1-51d3-afe9-9e0482cb7ac1",
"text": "Last stretch, tycoon. Big Bun Burgers and the Neon Palms club are both for sale.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "Last stretch, tycoon. Big Bun Burgers and the Neon Palms club are both for sale.",
"who": "marco"
},
{
"id": "s_547c572588",
"voice": "benji",
"vid": "e6f9b893-51b1-51d3-afe9-9e0482cb7ac1",
"text": "Own the whole skyline. Make this city yours.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "Own the whole skyline. Make this city yours.",
"who": "marco"
},
{
"id": "s_682ff9e8ab",
"voice": "benji",
"vid": "e6f9b893-51b1-51d3-afe9-9e0482cb7ac1",
"text": "From the bus stop to the skyline. Palm City is YOURS, cuz!",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "From the bus stop to the skyline. Palm City is YOURS, cuz!",
"who": "marco"
},
{
"id": "s_64ba004b01",
"voice": "fraser",
"vid": "6705e465-7b52-5915-a1d8-b1222885e01d",
"text": "You built it all. The city keeps earning — and the streets are yours to roam.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "You built it all. The city keeps earning — and the streets are yours to roam.",
"who": "narrator"
},
{
"id": "s_a0e313fd7c",
"voice": "fraser",
"vid": "6705e465-7b52-5915-a1d8-b1222885e01d",
"text": "Word travels fast when somebody buys half a city.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "Word travels fast when somebody buys half a city.",
"who": "narrator"
},
{
"id": "s_208c8cc6b2",
"voice": "arthur",
"vid": "30fc8796-ceb6-4a66-b3a7-4a145ef7f346",
"text": "You don't know me, but I know your little empire. Plaza fountain. Now.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "(phone) You don't know me, but I know your little empire. Plaza fountain. Now.",
"who": "vince"
},
{
"id": "s_3d43a746a6",
"voice": "arthur",
"vid": "30fc8796-ceb6-4a66-b3a7-4a145ef7f346",
"text": "Vince Sterling. I owned this town's money — until you showed up.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "Vince Sterling. I owned this town's money — until you showed up.",
"who": "vince"
},
{
"id": "s_8f1169d200",
"voice": "arthur",
"vid": "30fc8796-ceb6-4a66-b3a7-4a145ef7f346",
"text": "Sell me everything. Triple what you paid. Last offer, hotshot.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "Sell me everything. Triple what you paid. Last offer, hotshot.",
"who": "vince"
},
{
"id": "s_3a5d4dc2a6",
"voice": "arthur",
"vid": "30fc8796-ceb6-4a66-b3a7-4a145ef7f346",
"text": "Cute. Then I'll just take your customers instead.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "Cute. Then I'll just take your customers instead.",
"who": "vince"
},
{
"id": "s_5384fff258",
"voice": "benji",
"vid": "e6f9b893-51b1-51d3-afe9-9e0482cb7ac1",
"text": "Cuz, it's bad — Sterling parked his trucks outside everything you own. Income's bleeding!",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "Cuz, it's bad — Sterling parked his trucks outside everything you own. Income's bleeding!",
"who": "marco"
},
{
"id": "s_eaf48c2e03",
"voice": "benji",
"vid": "e6f9b893-51b1-51d3-afe9-9e0482cb7ac1",
"text": "Get out there and rally your crews. Show your face at every business you've got.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "Get out there and rally your crews. Show your face at every business you've got.",
"who": "marco"
},
{
"id": "s_2e6d4955c8",
"voice": "benji",
"vid": "e6f9b893-51b1-51d3-afe9-9e0482cb7ac1",
"text": "THAT'S how you hold a city. Your crews would walk through fire for you now.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "THAT'S how you hold a city. Your crews would walk through fire for you now.",
"who": "marco"
},
{
"id": "s_791a9e2af6",
"voice": "fraser",
"vid": "6705e465-7b52-5915-a1d8-b1222885e01d",
"text": "Loyalty earned: your businesses permanently earn 10% more.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "Loyalty earned: your businesses permanently earn 10% more.",
"who": "narrator"
},
{
"id": "s_c8b18081a9",
"voice": "soraya",
"vid": "5c1d2f7f-cdb4-5b1d-bca9-156439e3275e",
"text": "Hey, superstar. My art show opens tonight and my van just died. Be my driver?",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "(phone) Hey, superstar. My art show opens tonight and my van just died. Be my driver?",
"who": "rosa"
},
{
"id": "s_6d8f7adff0",
"voice": "benji",
"vid": "e6f9b893-51b1-51d3-afe9-9e0482cb7ac1",
"text": "Take care of her, cuz. And ask her about running the Neon Palms — she's got the eye.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "Take care of her, cuz. And ask her about running the Neon Palms — she's got the eye.",
"who": "marco"
},
{
"id": "s_284e210b0a",
"voice": "soraya",
"vid": "5c1d2f7f-cdb4-5b1d-bca9-156439e3275e",
"text": "You're a lifesaver! And tell Marco… yes. I'll run the club. Partners?",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "You're a lifesaver! And tell Marco… yes. I'll run the club. Partners?",
"who": "rosa"
},
{
"id": "s_a6dc6db61d",
"voice": "fraser",
"vid": "6705e465-7b52-5915-a1d8-b1222885e01d",
"text": "Rosa now manages the Neon Palms. Club income +25%.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "Rosa now manages the Neon Palms. Club income +25%.",
"who": "narrator"
},
{
"id": "s_5fa2bf443e",
"voice": "arthur",
"vid": "30fc8796-ceb6-4a66-b3a7-4a145ef7f346",
"text": "One last play, hotshot. A race — my circuit, right now, pride on the line.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "(phone) One last play, hotshot. A race — my circuit, right now, pride on the line.",
"who": "vince"
},
{
"id": "s_7acf90a43c",
"voice": "arthur",
"vid": "30fc8796-ceb6-4a66-b3a7-4a145ef7f346",
"text": "Beat the clock around the city and Palm City never hears from me again.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "Beat the clock around the city and Palm City never hears from me again.",
"who": "vince"
},
{
"id": "s_7f51d8d6cb",
"voice": "benji",
"vid": "e6f9b893-51b1-51d3-afe9-9e0482cb7ac1",
"text": "His record around that circuit is a minute forty. Smoke him, cuz.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "His record around that circuit is a minute forty. Smoke him, cuz.",
"who": "marco"
},
{
"id": "s_54e0dbdb9a",
"voice": "arthur",
"vid": "30fc8796-ceb6-4a66-b3a7-4a145ef7f346",
"text": "…Nobody beats that time. Nobody. The city's yours, kid. I'm out.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "…Nobody beats that time. Nobody. The city's yours, kid. I'm out.",
"who": "vince"
},
{
"id": "s_b14b6c6bca",
"voice": "benji",
"vid": "e6f9b893-51b1-51d3-afe9-9e0482cb7ac1",
"text": "From the bus stop to KING of Palm City! Pop would be proud.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "From the bus stop to KING of Palm City! Pop would be proud.",
"who": "marco"
},
{
"id": "s_4a3dfce36f",
"voice": "fraser",
"vid": "6705e465-7b52-5915-a1d8-b1222885e01d",
"text": "You've won it all. The city keeps earning — and the streets are forever yours.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "You've won it all. The city keeps earning — and the streets are forever yours.",
"who": "narrator"
},
{
"id": "s_99cfdb8b4c",
"voice": "fraser",
"vid": "6705e465-7b52-5915-a1d8-b1222885e01d",
"text": "Sterling's gone. Something worse is circling.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "Sterling's gone. Something worse is circling.",
"who": "narrator"
},
{
"id": "s_d492f91e5f",
"voice": "benji",
"vid": "e6f9b893-51b1-51d3-afe9-9e0482cb7ac1",
"text": "Cuz — that black sedan outside the plaza? Moreno's lieutenant. Follow him. Don't get close, don't lose him.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "(phone) Cuz — that black sedan outside the plaza? Moreno's lieutenant. Follow him. Don't get close, don't lose him.",
"who": "marco"
},
{
"id": "s_ac28a56a45",
"voice": "benji",
"vid": "e6f9b893-51b1-51d3-afe9-9e0482cb7ac1",
"text": "A warehouse by the marina. So that's where the Shark keeps his teeth.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "A warehouse by the marina. So that's where the Shark keeps his teeth.",
"who": "marco"
},
{
"id": "s_2212ad7631",
"voice": "benji",
"vid": "e6f9b893-51b1-51d3-afe9-9e0482cb7ac1",
"text": "Moreno's courier is running his books across town right now!",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "(phone) Moreno's courier is running his books across town right now!",
"who": "marco"
},
{
"id": "s_eef74ee80e",
"voice": "benji",
"vid": "e6f9b893-51b1-51d3-afe9-9e0482cb7ac1",
"text": "Run him off the road — ram him, shoot him, whatever. Just stop that car.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "Run him off the road — ram him, shoot him, whatever. Just stop that car.",
"who": "marco"
},
{
"id": "s_69eda6b02c",
"voice": "benji",
"vid": "e6f9b893-51b1-51d3-afe9-9e0482cb7ac1",
"text": "The ledger! Every crooked cop and every bribe in this city, written down.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "The ledger! Every crooked cop and every bribe in this city, written down.",
"who": "marco"
},
{
"id": "s_6263b8f783",
"voice": "grady",
"vid": "e2a2d2e6-9ed2-59cd-82af-feaa27f8a678",
"text": "You just made the worst mistake of your little life.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "(phone) You just made the worst mistake of your little life.",
"who": "vic"
},
{
"id": "s_f8194d668d",
"voice": "soraya",
"vid": "5c1d2f7f-cdb4-5b1d-bca9-156439e3275e",
"text": "They're outside the Neon Palms with guns! Please — get here!",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "(phone) They're outside the Neon Palms with guns! Please — get here!",
"who": "rosa"
},
{
"id": "s_a3af3c5805",
"voice": "benji",
"vid": "e6f9b893-51b1-51d3-afe9-9e0482cb7ac1",
"text": "Hold that club, cuz. Nobody takes what's ours.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "Hold that club, cuz. Nobody takes what's ours.",
"who": "marco"
},
{
"id": "s_d61f185ffe",
"voice": "soraya",
"vid": "5c1d2f7f-cdb4-5b1d-bca9-156439e3275e",
"text": "You came. You actually came. The club's still standing — because of you.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "You came. You actually came. The club's still standing — because of you.",
"who": "rosa"
},
{
"id": "s_0635917eb5",
"voice": "benji",
"vid": "e6f9b893-51b1-51d3-afe9-9e0482cb7ac1",
"text": "We need ears on Moreno. His boat's tied up at the yard below the promenade.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "We need ears on Moreno. His boat's tied up at the yard below the promenade.",
"who": "marco"
},
{
"id": "s_a21994d2a9",
"voice": "benji",
"vid": "e6f9b893-51b1-51d3-afe9-9e0482cb7ac1",
"text": "Plant this bug on it. His guys are watching — stay out of their sight, and don't run near them.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "Plant this bug on it. His guys are watching — stay out of their sight, and don't run near them.",
"who": "marco"
},
{
"id": "s_2e63f9762b",
"voice": "benji",
"vid": "e6f9b893-51b1-51d3-afe9-9e0482cb7ac1",
"text": "We're in. Every word he says on that boat, we hear.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "We're in. Every word he says on that boat, we hear.",
"who": "marco"
},
{
"id": "s_2e2a18b3d0",
"voice": "soraya",
"vid": "5c1d2f7f-cdb4-5b1d-bca9-156439e3275e",
"text": "The gallery wants the whole collection tonight. Moreno knows it's in my van.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "(phone) The gallery wants the whole collection tonight. Moreno knows it's in my van.",
"who": "rosa"
},
{
"id": "s_1df261bb7a",
"voice": "soraya",
"vid": "5c1d2f7f-cdb4-5b1d-bca9-156439e3275e",
"text": "Ride with me? Stay close. If they hit the van, the paintings are gone.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "Ride with me? Stay close. If they hit the van, the paintings are gone.",
"who": "rosa"
},
{
"id": "s_4b02039008",
"voice": "soraya",
"vid": "5c1d2f7f-cdb4-5b1d-bca9-156439e3275e",
"text": "Not a scratch. Okay — maybe I like having you around.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "Not a scratch. Okay — maybe I like having you around.",
"who": "rosa"
},
{
"id": "s_32b37af1d6",
"voice": "benji",
"vid": "e6f9b893-51b1-51d3-afe9-9e0482cb7ac1",
"text": "That bug picked up a shipment — Moreno's moving something fragile by the marina.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "That bug picked up a shipment — Moreno's moving something fragile by the marina.",
"who": "marco"
},
{
"id": "s_ee104559f3",
"voice": "benji",
"vid": "e6f9b893-51b1-51d3-afe9-9e0482cb7ac1",
"text": "We grabbed it first. Drive it to the marina before his people notice. Gently, cuz. Gently.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "We grabbed it first. Drive it to the marina before his people notice. Gently, cuz. Gently.",
"who": "marco"
},
{
"id": "s_dc05c71ac8",
"voice": "benji",
"vid": "e6f9b893-51b1-51d3-afe9-9e0482cb7ac1",
"text": "Delivered in one piece. Moreno's going to be FURIOUS.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "Delivered in one piece. Moreno's going to be FURIOUS.",
"who": "marco"
},
{
"id": "s_ec93f8f96d",
"voice": "holden",
"vid": "3c9d6053-6334-592c-8997-4e325286af3f",
"text": "All units: suspect in the Moreno shootings is on foot downtown. Approach with caution.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "(radio) All units: suspect in the Moreno shootings is on foot downtown. Approach with caution.",
"who": "ruiz"
},
{
"id": "s_d3fc4cdd22",
"voice": "benji",
"vid": "e6f9b893-51b1-51d3-afe9-9e0482cb7ac1",
"text": "He bought the cops, cuz — they think YOU did it! Get to the safehouse and lose them!",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "(phone) He bought the cops, cuz — they think YOU did it! Get to the safehouse and lose them!",
"who": "marco"
},
{
"id": "s_cf6f2049f7",
"voice": "holden",
"vid": "3c9d6053-6334-592c-8997-4e325286af3f",
"text": "Detective Ruiz. I read the ledger you left on my desk. I know who you are… and who Moreno is.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "(phone) Detective Ruiz. I read the ledger you left on my desk. I know who you are… and who Moreno is.",
"who": "ruiz"
},
{
"id": "s_469f8b8525",
"voice": "holden",
"vid": "3c9d6053-6334-592c-8997-4e325286af3f",
"text": "Finish it. I'll make sure nobody's looking at the marina tonight.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "Finish it. I'll make sure nobody's looking at the marina tonight.",
"who": "ruiz"
},
{
"id": "s_c1010575f6",
"voice": "grady",
"vid": "e2a2d2e6-9ed2-59cd-82af-feaa27f8a678",
"text": "Enough. You want my city? Come and take it. The yard. Now.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "(phone) Enough. You want my city? Come and take it. The yard. Now.",
"who": "vic"
},
{
"id": "s_490787a9af",
"voice": "benji",
"vid": "e6f9b893-51b1-51d3-afe9-9e0482cb7ac1",
"text": "This is it, cuz. End it.",
"rate": 0,
"group": "story",
"sub": "This is it, cuz. End it.",
"who": "marco"
},
{
"id": "s_48802a552e",
